# Magileads MCP

# =============================================================================
# Multi-tenant (HTTP): clients authenticate PER REQUEST with their OWN Magileads
# API key — no server-side credentials or gate token are required. A client sends
# its key as one of:
#   X-Magileads-Api-Key: <key>      (header, preferred)
#   Authorization: Bearer <key>     (header)
#   ?api_key=<key>  (or ?token=<key>)  (URL — may appear in proxy logs)
# For a pure multi-tenant deployment, leave everything below UNSET.
# =============================================================================

# --- OPTIONAL default account ---
# Set these ONLY if you want a single default account used when a request carries
# no key (and by the stdio transport, which is always single-account). Choose ONE:
# MAGILEADS_API_KEY=
# MAGILEADS_EMAIL=you@example.com
# MAGILEADS_PASSWORD=
# Optional: override the API base URL (defaults to https://app.api-magileads.net).
# MAGILEADS_API_BASE=https://app.api-magileads.net

# --- HTTP transport (bun run src/http.ts — used for the Docker / remote deployment) ---
# Optional:
# MCP_HTTP_PORT=8080
# MCP_HTTP_PATH=/mcp
